  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PSD Thematic Exchange Mission to Benin</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Netherlands continues to support initiatives to improve sustainable trade and investment in Benin, while at the same time trying to attract Dutch investors and companies to stimulate bilateral trade and take a role in capacity strengthening of Beninese private sector. Dutch knowledge and expertise in agriculture and water sector could help tackling key challenges in these Beninese sectors. The purpose of this trajectory is to engage and involve Dutch private sector parties in contributing to overcome these challenges by sharing their innovative and sustainable solutions. As part of the trajectory, an exchange mission will be organised to promote exchange and business relations between Dutch and Beninese companies.</narrative>
  </description>
